{:component/id :orbiplex/whisper
 :component/title "Orbiplex Whisper"
 :component/type :node-attached-module
 :component/status :partial

 :summary
 "Node-attached social-signal exchange with implemented Agora M4 intake,
 redaction, thresholding, opt-in association bootstrap and artifact traces;
 partial local assessment exposure and planned privacy/authorship continuations."

 :must-implement
